# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trained model artifacts.
#
# These SHIP WITH THE REPO. A deployed instance (Streamlit Cloud) has no artifact
# store and cannot retrain itself — training needs multi-season history that is not
# deployed — so without the model in git the app permanently runs the emergency
# heuristic. They are ~400KB each, in LightGBM's portable text format.
#
# Everything else under data/models/ (versioned per-GW snapshots) stays local.
# Note: this must be `data/models/*`, not `data/models/`; git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/models/*
!data/models/lgb_ts_points.txt
!data/models/lgb_ts_points.meta.json
!data/models/lgb_ts_minutes.txt
!data/models/lgb_ts_minutes.meta.json
